+## Changed
+
+- Deleted `src/core/status/leftover-drafts.ts` and its `findLeftoverDrafts` /
+  `LeftoverDraft` exports.
+- `src/core/status/status.ts`: dropped the `leftovers` field from
+  `StatusOverview`, `checkoutChanged` from `ChangeWorktree`, the
+  `checkoutCopyChanged` helper, the unused `hashChangeFolder` and `path`
+  imports, and both the `Leftover drafts:` section and the checkout-copy
+  warning from `formatStatusOverview`. `getStatusOverview` no longer lists or
+  filters leftover folders.
+- `src/core/vcs/land.ts`: `cleanupChange` now removes only the worktree; no
+  `Removed leftover draft` line and no `findLeftoverDrafts`/`fs` imports.
+- Deleted `tests/status-leftover.test.ts`.
+- `tests/status-worktree.test.ts`, `tests/status-sync.test.ts`: dropped
+  `checkoutChanged` and checkout-copy-warning assertions; the tests that used
+  to edit approval's checkout copy now write their own folder with
+  `fs.mkdir`/`fs.writeFile` and assert no warning prints.
+- `tests/vcs-land.test.ts`: dropped the `Removed leftover draft` and
+  `exists(checkoutFolder) === false` assertions; the keeps-a-leftover test now
+  writes its own copy; `tests/vcs-land-commit.test.ts`: "Progress on stderr"
+  expects three stdout lines.
+- Added `tests/checkout-copy-ignored.test.ts`, building repositories like
+  `tests/vcs-land.test.ts` and covering status-inspection's "Edited checkout
+  copy" / "Untouched checkout copy" and version-control's "Edited leftover copy
+  is kept" / "Landed by hand, worktree kept" / "Land after archive".
+
+## Deviated
+
+- Acceptance 3 says the only changes to the four listed tests are the
+  removals/replacements it names, but the two `assert.equal(await
+  exists(checkoutFolder(...)), false)` assertions in `tests/vcs-land.test.ts`
+  had to go as well: they passed only because `land` deleted the leftover.
+  Keeping them would fail in this task (approval still leaves the copy) and in
+  task 3 (approval removes it), so the checkout copy's presence is no longer
+  asserted there; the new "Land after archive" test covers the archive-only
+  checkout instead.
+- The `tests/status-sync.test.ts` test name dropped "and warnings" since it no
+  longer asserts a warning ordering.
+
+## Missing context
+
+- Task 2 must leave every listed test green while approval still leaves the
+  checkout copy and task 3 removes it. Assertions about whether the checkout
+  folder survives a land cannot hold in both states, so I removed them rather
+  than assert a state that flips between tasks.
+
+Touched: src/core/status/leftover-drafts.ts, src/core/status/status.ts, src/core/vcs/land.ts, tests/status-leftover.test.ts, tests/status-worktree.test.ts, tests/status-sync.test.ts, tests/vcs-land.test.ts, tests/vcs-land-commit.test.ts, tests/checkout-copy-ignored.test.ts
